              "ImageDescription": {
                "value": "朝の<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Kannami_Station\" title=\"Category:Kannami Station\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r328721481\">'\"`UNIQ--templatestyles-00000001-QINU`\"'</style><ruby><rb>函南</rb><rp> (</rp><rt>かんなみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>駅</a>を通過する<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:T%C5%8Dkaid%C5%8D_Main_Line\" title=\"Category:Tōkaidō Main Line\">東海道本線</a>の上り寝台特急「<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Fuji_(train,_1964-2009)\" title=\"Category:Fuji (train, 1964-2009)\">富士</a>・<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Hayabusa_(train,_1958-2009)\" title=\"Category:Hayabusa (train, 1958-2009)\">はやぶさ</a>」<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Tokyo_Station\" title=\"Category:Tokyo Station\">東京</a>行き。牽引機は<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:EF66_0_(JR_West)\" title=\"Category:EF66 0 (JR West)\">EF66</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>。前の客車6輛が「はやぶさ」、後の6輛が「富士」である。駅を過ぎると<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Tanna_Tunnel\" title=\"Category:Tanna Tunnel\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r328721481\"><ruby><rb>丹</rb><rp> (</rp><rt>たん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r328721481\"><ruby><rb>那</rb><rp> (</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>トンネル</a>へ入って行く。",
                "source": "commons-desc-page"
              },
              "DateTimeOriginal": {
                "value": "Taken on  15 February 2009 between circa 08:21 and circa 08:25",
