            "slots": {
              "main": {
                "contentmodel": "wikitext",
                "contentformat": "text/x-wiki",
                "*": "== {{int:filedesc}} ==\n{{Information\n|description={{ja|1=朝の{{c|Kannami Station|{{ruby|函南|かんなみ}}駅}}を通過する{{c|Tōkaidō Main Line|東海道本線}}の上り寝台特急「{{c|Fuji (train, 1964-2009)|富士}}・{{c|Hayabusa (train, 1958-2009)|はやぶさ}}」{{c|Tokyo Station|東京}}行き。牽引機は{{c|EF66 0 (JR West)|EF66}}<ref>映像では不鮮明で判別できないが、同日に撮影した複数の撮影者によれば、48号機だったようである。[https://blog.goo.ne.jp/pony4649_2006/e/425bda53cffbffb772266b3a78907f5b (a)]、[https://ef166.blog.fc2.com/page-148.html (b)]</ref>。前の客車6輛が「はやぶさ」、後の6輛が「富士」である。駅を過ぎると{{c|Tanna Tunnel|{{ruby|丹|たん}}{{ruby|那|な}}トンネル}}へ入って行く。}}{{nl|1=Loc {{c|EF66 0 (JR West)|EF66}} met de nachttreinen {{c|Fuji (train, 1964-2009)|''Fuji''}} en {{c|Hayabusa (train, 1958-2009)|''Hayabusa''}} passeert {{c|Kannami Station|station Kannami}} en rijdt {{c|Tanna Tunnel|Tannatunnel}} in, op weg richting {{c|Tokyo Station|Tokio}}. De voorste 6 rijtuigen staan ''Hayabusa'' uit {{c|Kumamoto Station|Kumamoto}}, en de achterste 6 staan ''Fuji'' uit {{c|Ōita Station|Ōita}}.}}\n----\n<small>{{reflist}}</small>\n----\n<div style=\"font-size:78%\">[[File:GreenDownArrow.svg|10px]] Ik heb de GPS coördinaten toegevoegd. De foutenmarge moet tussen ±5 meter liggen. --[[User:トトト|トトト]] ([[User talk:トトト|<span class=\"signature-talk\">{{int:Talkpagelinktext}}</span>]]) 17:07, 16 May 2021 (UTC)\n|date={{Taken on|cat=no}} {{ISO date|2009-02-15}} {{otherdate|~|08:21|08:25}}\n|source={{From YouTube|1=_B7hcQLzSJg|2=2009/02/15 函南駅 「富士」「はやぶさ」通過}}<br />''van 0m 46s t.e.m 1m 34s''\n|author=[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8idc67Hd2s0l6lVAlvTpeg Haruna Kurita]\n|permission=\n|other versions=\n}}\n{{Location dec|35.10867276601797|138.97253392192377|region:JP_scale:5000<!--toegevoegd door トトト-->}}\n\n=={{int:license-header}}==\n{{YouTube CC-BY|[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8idc67Hd2s0l6lVAlvTpeg Haruna Kurita]}}\n{{YouTubeReview|id=_B7hcQLzSJg|ChannelName=Haruna Kurita|ChannelID=UC8idc67Hd2s0l6lVAlvTpeg|title=2009/02/15 函南駅 「富士」「はやぶさ」通過|archive=https://web.archive.org/web/20210516165325/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_B7hcQLzSJg|date=2021-05-16|reviewer=廣九直通車}}\n\n[[Category:EF66 0 (JR West)]]\n[[Category:Fuji (train, 1964-2009)]]\n[[Category:Hayabusa (train, 1958-2009)]]\n[[Category:Kannami Station]]\n[[Category:Trains at train stations in Shizuoka prefecture]]\n[[Category:Tanna Tunnel]]\n[[Category:Trains in tunnels in Japan]]\n[[Category:Videos of passenger trains]]\n[[Category:Videos of rail transport in Shizuoka prefecture]]\n[[Category:Videos of 2009 from Japan]]\n[[Category:Morning in Shizuoka prefecture]]\n[[Category:February 2009 in rail transport in Shizuoka prefecture]]\n[[Category:Video display resolution 640 x 480]]\n[[Category:WebM videos]]\n[[Category:Japan photographs taken on 2009-02-15]]"
              }
            }
